{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>油麻地發生上吊事件。昨晚（13日）9時許，警方接獲一名女子報案，發現其13歲女兒在彌敦道546號旺角大樓住所房間上吊，她將女兒解下。</p><p>救護員接報到場，證實女童當場死亡。經初步調查，相信女童在上址用一條尼龍繩上吊，警方在現場檢獲遺書，死因有待驗屍後確定。</p><figure><img alt=\"現場為油麻地彌敦道546號旺角大樓。（Google街景截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261014/1186863849236598784837609.jpeg/cgJF9CdsmffksijeOiACaFFO_SoyasNHuBGVwbgRlcE\"/><figcaption>現場為油麻地彌敦道546號旺角大樓。（Google街景截圖）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-14T01:39:05.517735+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":157,"images":1,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-13T18:49:11+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-14T01:32:24.291704+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-14T01:32:24.291704+00:00","content_hash":"9c6dbafb496cb5073abada172d730809b7c8e908a7a3f2ee92aa56e6dae23c7e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}